d respect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning your way into the underground RC car races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning how to talk to the girl next door.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning how to talk to your dad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new choices. Sometimes you win. Sometimes you spill the lemonade. But with each cup sold, you grow a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050870/extras/3fb1e0a0a59ee63b3c2ce08264905fe7.poster.avif?t=1759849507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050870/extras/3fb1e0a0a59ee63b3c2ce08264905fe7.webm?t=1759849507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>limited demo</strong> showcasing an early slice of the game. Some locations, quests, characters, and features are unavailable here and will appear in the full version. Content, balance, and progression may change; saves from the demo may not carry over.</p>","developers":["EBS"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3989250","name":"I Sell Lemonade"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050870/539f2c94265d52ae28727c9a87a57ed72b8cc51b/header.jpg?t=1759849507","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050870/1279958508/e69e129b18c3dd18c49098cf175679b03e9dab37/1758872276/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759504193","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050870/1279958508/e69e129b18c3dd18c